<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Submit — The Cardboard Box</title>

    <style>

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #5A0F18;
            color: #F4EBDD;
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }


        /* NAVIGATION */

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;

            padding: 28px 6%;

            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 235, 221, 0.35);
        }

        .nav-logo {
            font-size: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;

            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            opacity: 0.6;
        }


        /* MAIN */

        main {
            max-width: 950px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 100px 7%;
        }

        .label {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 20px 0 30px;

            font-size: clamp(55px, 9vw, 100px);
            font-weight: normal;
            line-height: 0.95;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
        }

        .intro {
            max-width: 650px;

            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }


        /* GUIDELINES */

        .guidelines {
            margin-top: 90px;

            border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 235, 221, 0.35);
        }

        .guideline {
            padding: 30px 0;

            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244, 235, 221, 0.35);
        }

        .guideline h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;

            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .guideline p {
            max-width: 700px;

            margin: 0;

            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;

            opacity: 0.85;
        }


        /* FORM AREA */

        .form-section {
            margin-top: 100px;

            padding: 55px;

            background-color: #F4EBDD;
            color: #5A0F18;
        }

        .form-section h2 {
            margin-top: 0;

            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .form-section p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .form-button {
            display: inline-block;

            margin-top: 20px;

            padding: 15px 30px;

            border: 1px solid #5A0F18;

            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;

            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .form-button:hover {
            background-color: #5A0F18;
            color: #F4EBDD;
        }


        /* FOOTER */

        footer {
            padding: 50px 7%;

            border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 235, 221, 0.35);

            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;

            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }


        /* MOBILE */

        @media (max-width: 700px) {

            nav {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .nav-links {
                gap: 18px;
            }

            main {
                padding-top: 70px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 60px;
            }

            .form-section {
                padding: 30px;
            }

            footer {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }
        }

    </style>
</head>


<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->

    <nav>

        <div class="nav-logo">
            <a href="index.html">The Cardboard Box</a>
        </div>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html">Home</a>
            <a href="index.html#about">About</a>
            <a href="submit.html">Submit</a>
        </div>

    </nav>


    <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->

    <main>

        <div class="label">
            Submissions
        </div>

        <h1>
            Open the box.
        </h1>

        <p class="intro">
            A journal for young, emerging writers.
            If you've got something you've been keeping tucked away,
            we'd love to read it.
        </p>


        <!-- GUIDELINES -->

        <section class="guidelines">

            <div class="guideline">

                <h2>Who can submit?</h2>

                <p>
                    The Cardboard Box is open to young and emerging writers.
                    You don't need to have been published before.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="guideline">

                <h2>What do we accept?</h2>

                <p>
                    We accept poetry, fiction, creative nonfiction,
                    personal essays, and other forms of creative writing.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="guideline">

                <h2>How long can my submission be?</h2>

                <p>
                    Short stories and essays should generally be under
                    5,000 words. Poetry submissions may contain up to
                    five poems.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="guideline">

                <h2>What should I send?</h2>

                <p>
                    Please submit your work as a PDF or Word document.
                    Include your name, email address, the title of your
                    work, and a short biography.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="guideline">

                <h2>Is there a submission fee?</h2>

                <p>
                    No. Submissions to The Cardboard Box are completely free.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="guideline">

                <h2>What happens after I submit?</h2>

                <p>
                    Every submission will be read by our editorial team.
                    If we decide to publish your work, we'll contact you
                    using the email address provided.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- SUBMISSION FORM -->

        <section class="form-section">

            <h2>
                Ready to share?
            </h2>

            <p>
                Fill out our submission form and send us the piece
                you've been keeping in your cardboard box.
            </p>

            <!-- WE WILL PUT YOUR GOOGLE FORM LINK HERE -->

            <a
                class="form-button"
                href="PASTE-YOUR-GOOGLE-FORM-LINK-HERE"
                target="_blank">
                Submit Your Work
            </a>

        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- FOOTER -->

    <footer>

        <div>
            The Cardboard Box
        </div>

        <div>
            © 2026
        </div>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
